-- Ask 'Do you hold Swiss citizenship? yes/no' only
+- Ask the spouse's nationality as a country; a Swiss spouse is entered as Switzerland (current model)
+- Ask 'Is your spouse/partner Swiss? yes/no' only, as for the employee
 
